flowchart TB
    App["應用程式／後端"] -->|"MQTT 或已簽署 HTTP"| Shadow["影子狀態服務"]
    Shadow <-->|"GET、desired、reported"| Device["裝置韌體"]
    Device --> Broker["MQTT Broker"]
    Device --> WS["裝置 WebSocket 端點"]
    Broker -->|"SDK owner 協定"| Owner["唯一有效的 owner 傳輸連線"]
    WS -->|"優先順序較高"| Owner
    Command["支援的裝置命令路由"] --> Owner
    Owner -->|"只送往目前 owner"| Device
    Observer["只操作影子的教學用戶端"] --> Broker
    Observer -.->|"不建立 owner 生命週期"| Owner
